Description: Provides functions to estimate optimal plot size for
    experimental design, based on the relationship between the
    coefficient of variation and plot size. Implements the linear
    response plateau (LRP) and quadratic response plateau (QRP) models,
    with standardized diagnostic statistics and plotting.
